      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The verifier set",
      "prov:value": "A key the `@context` does\nnot declare is DROPPED by a processor, silently — the first run found the\nvocabulary losing `layer` on all 159 terms and the fsh-guts export losing\n`skipped`."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/publish-verification.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "A verifier the preview cannot ask is a release failure waiting (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "**That promise breaks wherever the preview\nanswers a different question.** It serves the PUBLISHED search index\n(`--search-index borrowed`), so `search-index` there asks only \"present and\nparsing\", never \"does it cover the pages\". #2194 was green in its preview, and\nits production publish was refused (#2233): *\"indexes 1003 page(s) while 4189\noffer a search box\"*.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#2194",
        "#2233"
      ]
    },
